; A bare `any` type-choice arm in LAST position (`tstr / any`) is a SUPPORTED construct (loose-CBOR
; A3): the arm lowers to the AnyCbor runtime type and dispatches via forced backtracking (a typed arm
; matching on wire type but failing on content falls through to the `any` catch-all — DESIGN §3.5).
